WEBVTT

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.125
Newspaper!

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:16.625
"The terror, Koshi Rikdo,

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:22.042
gives permission to turn the
Excel Saga anime into a horror.

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:28.333
And those who read this newspaper
will be presented with a cute pet."

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:51.583
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:55.375
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:00:55.375 --> 00:01:03.333
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:07.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:11.208
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:18.917
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:23.750
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.792
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:31.708
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:34.917
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:34.917 --> 00:01:37.208
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:39.083
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:40.833
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.875
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:47.583
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:50.833
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:55.375
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:01:55.375 --> 00:02:03.208
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:10.417
"Presenting"

00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:13.792
"Excel"

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.167
Man, that was awful.

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.833
Who would have thought
we'd be saved by a yeti there?

00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:20.625
It is such an unbelievable story.

00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:21.708
"Excel"

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:23.500
"Hyatt"

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:27.542
And the yeti's fur
sold for a good price too.

00:02:27.542 --> 00:02:29.875
You certainly returned the
favor straight back with a wrong.

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:30.917
"Hyatt"

00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:32.667
"Ilpalazzo"

00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:36.125
Well, this is a noble sacrifice
for the conquest of the city.

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:37.458
And in order not
to waste that sacrifice,

00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:39.292
I'll work myself up to
a shot of action today too!

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.958
"The other usual people"

00:02:45.792 --> 00:02:48.542
Hail, Ilpala...

00:02:48.542 --> 00:02:49.792
Oh?

00:02:49.792 --> 00:02:52.125
Lord Ilpalazzo is not here-ing!

00:02:52.125 --> 00:02:55.250
Why? How come?
It's where did he go for what?

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.208
It's dark! It's darkness!

00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:04.167
What is wrong, Excel?

00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:08.125
The lights will turn on now,
Lord Ilpalazzo.

00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:09.458
Oh?

00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:12.125
It seems that you were
able to pay the power bill

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:15.250
that we had been
delinquent in paying, lawfully.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.417
Yes, it was the money we
made from selling Mr. Yeti's fur.

00:03:18.417 --> 00:03:21.833
L-Lord Ilpalazzo,
you're rather unexpectedly playful.

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:25.000
My heart felt a bit
of a squeeze there.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.750
That was somewhat short
of funny, Excel.

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:34.042
Are you all right?

00:03:34.042 --> 00:03:35.833
You're well prepared, Hatchan.

00:03:35.833 --> 00:03:39.458
Unfortunately, our plan last
time ended in failure.

00:03:39.458 --> 00:03:43.000
I am very sorry! I regret it
more deeply than the ocean!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.167
As deep as this?

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.417
See you later, again!

00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:49.333
And? Why did you fail?

00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:53.833
Actually, there seemed to be
some sort of counter-operation, so...

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:59.417
Perhaps there really is
an enemy organization out there.

00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:00.208
--Oh, my.

00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:01.208
--Well, these will be the first intruders
--Oh, my.

00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:03.708
we've had in our
headquarters for a while.

00:04:03.708 --> 00:04:05.208
Intruders....

00:04:06.792 --> 00:04:11.042
Wow, I never knew such
wide sewer passages existed.

00:04:11.042 --> 00:04:14.125
It doesn't stink that
much for sewage though.

00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:15.167
So? What are we going to do?

00:04:15.167 --> 00:04:16.042
"Let's investigate!"

00:04:16.042 --> 00:04:19.208
Isn't this a job for
the water department?

00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:23.208
Quit complaining!
Now, follow the leader!

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:25.708
Since when did
you become the leader?

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:28.583
I don't really care, but our mission is...

00:04:33.042 --> 00:04:34.625
"What's wrong?"

00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:36.875
It's a rat, probably.

00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:37.917
Let's go.

00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:41.375
That's right! For now, our mission
is to investigate the sewer passages.

00:04:41.375 --> 00:04:42.833
Fall in!

00:04:43.333 --> 00:04:45.958
"Security room, do not enter!"

00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:48.458
But due to emergency
circumstances, overruled!

00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:50.375
'Scuse us!

00:04:54.875 --> 00:04:59.250
Is this really the security room?

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:04.833
The mood is more like a
discipline and interrogation room.

00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:06.375
Discovered security-ish system!

00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:07.250
"Main Power On Off"

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.833
Power on!

00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:09.625
"ACROSS 2000"

00:05:10.292 --> 00:05:12.917
Ah, so these must be the victims.

00:05:12.917 --> 00:05:14.833
Senior, aren't they intruders?

00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:17.042
Oh, I guess you
could call them that too.

00:05:17.042 --> 00:05:19.167
Well, they're going
to get promoted to victims

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:20.833
in just a couple minutes anyway.

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:23.625
All right, coordinates confirmed.

00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:26.583
Targets currently
passing through A-8.

00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:29.292
Let's eliminate them. Prepare traps!

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:30.958
Uh, well...

00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:34.292
What's wrong, Hatchan?
What are you worrying about now?

00:05:36.792 --> 00:05:39.375
What shall we do, Senior?

00:05:39.375 --> 00:05:41.958
You can't tell what's what at all.

00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:44.958
However, teacakes!

00:05:44.958 --> 00:05:47.292
In combat, we don't have
the luxury to think about it much!

00:05:47.292 --> 00:05:50.625
In that case, we will squash
probability theory with our spirit

00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:51.958
and shoot him.

00:05:51.958 --> 00:05:54.292
In other words, guess wildly.

00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:56.417
Exactly, yes!

00:05:56.417 --> 00:05:58.292
Go to death.

00:05:59.208 --> 00:06:01.542
T-The path!

00:06:01.542 --> 00:06:02.917
Why?

00:06:02.917 --> 00:06:05.042
Maybe it's something
like an automatic door?

00:06:05.042 --> 00:06:06.833
For a mere sewer passage?

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:09.750
Would it be that weird?
Automatic doors in sewer passages...

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.833
They wouldn't normally have them.
Not normally!

00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:12.792
"It won't open."

00:06:12.792 --> 00:06:14.958
So we've been locked in.

00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:16.833
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:19.542
Oh, there'll be other exits.

00:06:19.542 --> 00:06:23.625
Besides, if it comes down to that,
we've got this guy here too.

00:06:23.625 --> 00:06:24.292
"Don't wave it around!"

00:06:24.292 --> 00:06:26.125
What if it goes off by accident?!

00:06:26.125 --> 00:06:29.500
Don't worry! This time,
it's the model 2, after all. See?

00:06:29.667 --> 00:06:31.583
"That's no comfort to know."

00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:34.000
Anyway, just stay quiet.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.333
Wanna try firing this?

00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:38.000
Stop it! Don't touch it!
Don't take aim!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.667
I kind of get a feeling of success!

00:06:42.667 --> 00:06:44.042
Truly my senior coworker...

00:06:44.042 --> 00:06:48.000
Come on, Hatchan,
go for it and push a button too!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.708
Then, without any hesitation...

00:06:50.708 --> 00:06:52.208
Go for it.

00:06:56.417 --> 00:07:00.208
Senior, it was not on purpose...

00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:02.208
Yeah, I believe you.

00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:06.542
Now, let's get back into
the spirit of things and go, go!

00:07:06.542 --> 00:07:09.167
Hatchan, next please.

00:07:09.875 --> 00:07:11.542
Go for it.

00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:15.125
Senior...

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:16.792
I want to believe you.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:27.083
<i>Even as I stand here, my men</i>
<i>are preventing danger from occurring.</i>

00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:31.958
<i>Ah, the ecstasy of</i>
<i>protecting the peace!</i>

00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:33.042
<i>If I had my way,</i>

00:07:33.042 --> 00:07:36.458
<i>I would have plunged</i>
<i>myself into the battle as well,</i>

00:07:36.458 --> 00:07:39.708
<i>but I am old now,</i>
<i>after all. It is too late...</i>

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:46.750
No, age has nothing to do
with those who desire peace.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.750
<i>Just a little bit...</i>

00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:51.792
<i>What are you thinking, Kabapu?!</i>

00:07:51.792 --> 00:07:55.375
<i>Are you going to push yourself recklessly?!</i>
<i>Think of your age!</i>

00:08:02.417 --> 00:08:04.333
Excuse me, Sir.

00:08:04.333 --> 00:08:07.042
About the complaint regarding the sewers...

00:08:15.292 --> 00:08:17.917
Don't look! Don't look! Don't look!

00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:21.125
Nothing really seems
to be out of place.

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:24.167
That Kaba! Maybe he's senile.

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:28.125
Man, this was my chance
to show off how cool I was too.

00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:30.625
How many times do
I have to tell you to quit that?!

00:08:30.625 --> 00:08:31.625
Or we'll leave you behind!

00:08:31.625 --> 00:08:34.958
Watanabe, are your ears ringing?

00:08:34.958 --> 00:08:37.000
Come to think of it...

00:08:38.375 --> 00:08:41.083
I can hear something.

00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:43.958
When your ears start
ringing in an enclosed place...

00:08:43.958 --> 00:08:46.625
It means that the pressure
has changed, right?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.958
"Isn't that the sound of water?"

00:08:49.667 --> 00:08:51.167
Hurry up and run!

00:08:51.167 --> 00:08:52.542
And where do you suggest we run?!

00:08:52.542 --> 00:08:55.625
Or rather, is it time
to use this after all?

00:08:55.625 --> 00:08:58.333
How's that going to help?!

00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:01.875
Oh, I know, you're an idiot!
Haha, idiot! Idiot!

00:09:03.542 --> 00:09:05.542
And now for the oxy-gum...

00:09:05.542 --> 00:09:08.500
Matsuya, what's up with this
seamless procedure you're doing!?

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.250
Do you want to die?

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.417
The sound is close.

00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:16.500
What?!

00:09:17.583 --> 00:09:18.167
"Flood"

00:09:18.167 --> 00:09:19.458
"Flood"
"Water (lots)"

00:09:20.833 --> 00:09:22.958
Did you see that,
mysterious intruders?!

00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:24.458
Senior?

00:09:27.417 --> 00:09:30.167
T-There's something there!
There's a whole swarm of them!

00:09:30.167 --> 00:09:31.625
Intruders are here and there, everywhere!

00:09:31.625 --> 00:09:33.167
Bastards, goddamn!

00:09:33.167 --> 00:09:35.833
Fine then,
I'll set off all the traps at once.

00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:48.583
What are we,
filth in a flushable toilet?!

00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:54.125
Looks like things have settled down.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.042
"Mmm...?"

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.042
"So, we got separated..."

00:10:04.208 --> 00:10:05.750
"So cuuute..."

00:10:15.542 --> 00:10:16.083
"Oh?"

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:25.917
"It's super cute."

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.000
"Wait for me."

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.125
"Huh?"

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.750
"Aaah"

00:10:53.708 --> 00:10:56.208
What the hell happened?

00:10:56.208 --> 00:10:58.167
You okay?

00:10:58.167 --> 00:10:59.625
Not conscious.

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:03.292
Anyone able to call an
ambulance, call one!

00:11:04.292 --> 00:11:06.458
Defenseless lips!

00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:11.708
Now is the time for a loving
and touching mouth-to-mouth!

00:11:11.708 --> 00:11:13.958
Looks like you made it, Iwata.

00:11:19.167 --> 00:11:23.500
"It's over... My summer
and my dream..."

00:11:24.458 --> 00:11:25.333
<i>--Bones, check.</i>

00:11:25.333 --> 00:11:26.167
--Normally, you'd have her shyly blush a little bit,
<i>--Bones, check.</i>

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:29.542
--Normally, you'd have her shyly blush a little bit,
<i>--Joints, check.</i>

00:11:29.542 --> 00:11:30.208
--Normally, you'd have her shyly blush a little bit,
<i>--Eyes and ears, check.</i>

00:11:30.208 --> 00:11:32.417
--or have her hug me as if she were lonely.
<i>--Eyes and ears, check.</i>

00:11:32.417 --> 00:11:33.125
--You'd normally get a reaction that builds up to a nice mood!

00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:35.667
<i>--Fist, check.</i>
--You'd normally get a reaction that builds up to a nice mood!

00:11:38.917 --> 00:11:40.792
What about Watanabe and Sumiyoshi?

00:11:40.792 --> 00:11:44.583
I-I don't know, I just woke
up a minute ago too.

00:11:44.583 --> 00:11:46.375
We might be in trouble if they
are unconscious somewhere.

00:11:46.375 --> 00:11:48.292
Let's hurry up and find them.

00:11:48.292 --> 00:11:50.667
I'm hurting enough
to go unconscious myself.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.000
Ow. Damn it...

00:11:55.833 --> 00:11:57.375
M-Miss Ayasugi!

00:11:57.375 --> 00:11:59.833
Why is she in a place like this?

00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:02.125
I don't get it. I don't get it at all.

00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:07.167
What is this?! What's going on?!
Is this a dream? Is it a dream?!

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.375
Hey, say something!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.500
Gross!

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:17.458
What the hell is this?!

00:12:19.167 --> 00:12:21.875
Welcome home, Dear!

00:12:21.875 --> 00:12:24.167
My darling Gomez!

00:12:24.167 --> 00:12:28.500
Wait a minute. I've brought a
guest with me today.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.542
Who?

00:12:29.542 --> 00:12:31.708
He says that he's a channeler.

00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:37.833
It's me! Your husband, Pedro!

00:12:37.833 --> 00:12:40.042
Shock!

00:12:40.542 --> 00:12:42.875
That's impossible!

00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:50.208
Once again, shock!

00:12:52.625 --> 00:12:54.750
Shock? Come on, Dear.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:59.917
--I came all this way by using the body of

00:12:59.917 --> 00:13:00.333
--Shock. Shock. Shock. Shock.
--a channeler to see you.

00:13:00.333 --> 00:13:04.083
--Shock. Shock. Shock. Shock.
--I don't think that's very fair of you.

00:13:04.083 --> 00:13:07.083
That's a lie! A lie, a lie!
Pedro kicked the bucket!

00:13:07.083 --> 00:13:09.417
But I am Pedro!

00:13:09.417 --> 00:13:12.750
It doesn't matter! Pedro doesn't
exist in my heart anymore!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.250
Not even a trace!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.917
Double shock!
And twin waterfalls of tears!

00:13:17.917 --> 00:13:21.333
Dear, it will be hard for you, but here...

00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.750
I have no choice.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:27.333
I didn't... I didn't want
to have to use this, but...

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:29.458
Begone, evil spirits!

00:13:29.458 --> 00:13:31.333
No! Flyswatter, no!

00:13:31.333 --> 00:13:32.542
And further!

00:13:32.542 --> 00:13:33.625
Further, no!

00:13:33.625 --> 00:13:36.000
A kick of reformation!

00:13:38.958 --> 00:13:42.583
I didn't want to do that. I didn't, but...

00:13:42.583 --> 00:13:44.833
It was a good kick, Dear.

00:13:44.833 --> 00:13:47.125
Come, I'll comfort you.

00:13:47.125 --> 00:13:49.125
Dear, it's the middle of the day...

00:13:49.958 --> 00:13:53.875
I have lost my physical body
and I have lost the love of my wife.

00:13:53.875 --> 00:13:57.625
Can there possibly be anyone
who could understand my sorrow?

00:13:57.625 --> 00:13:59.417
I want to shout out!

00:13:59.417 --> 00:14:01.958
From the bottom of my
heart and with all my might,

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:04.417
very <i>No</i>!

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:11.500
I got separated from Hatchan
and I don't know the way back.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:13.792
Could it be that I'm in a pretty bad fix?

00:14:13.792 --> 00:14:15.458
And who am I asking anyway?

00:14:15.458 --> 00:14:17.458
Besides, why is the ACROSS
headquarters connected

00:14:17.458 --> 00:14:20.333
to all these sewer
passages to begin with?

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.500
Damn, it's just a bunch of Puchuus.

00:14:28.333 --> 00:14:31.875
Well, they probably won't
particularly hinder the story,

00:14:31.875 --> 00:14:34.208
but it's kind of creepy!

00:14:34.917 --> 00:14:38.167
Why am I running?!
Why are you all chasing?!

00:14:41.333 --> 00:14:44.500
They're still chasing me!
They're all coming after me!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:47.000
Acceleration device switched on!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.542
Firing my jets too!

00:14:51.667 --> 00:14:53.125
I'm falling again!

00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:55.625
You there, is it fun watching
a pretty girl falling?!

00:14:55.625 --> 00:14:57.542
Oh, it is?

00:14:57.542 --> 00:14:59.083
Say, Misaki, you know what?

00:14:59.083 --> 00:15:01.708
As always, I wish you wouldn't
call me by my first name,

00:15:01.708 --> 00:15:02.667
but what?

00:15:02.667 --> 00:15:06.208
In horror movies, if a couple
gets to be by themselves,

00:15:06.208 --> 00:15:08.875
they usually get attacked by monsters.

00:15:09.042 --> 00:15:10.208
"Pow"

00:15:11.292 --> 00:15:13.750
I'm so glad we aren't a couple.

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:15.417
That's so cold.

00:15:16.625 --> 00:15:17.958
But still...

00:15:17.958 --> 00:15:19.750
What's with these interrogation tools

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:23.292
and impressive torture devices
that have been floating by?

00:15:24.167 --> 00:15:25.708
S-Stop it!

00:15:25.708 --> 00:15:27.042
B-But they're cute.

00:15:27.042 --> 00:15:28.250
But don't bite that!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.583
Don't pinch me there!

00:15:29.583 --> 00:15:31.875
Oh, but how darling, I almost
want to eat them up.

00:15:31.875 --> 00:15:34.083
But I'm the one being eaten!

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.375
That shattered some bone.

00:15:42.708 --> 00:15:44.375
M-Misaki!

00:15:45.125 --> 00:15:48.667
So you've stood up for me after all!

00:15:48.667 --> 00:15:51.583
You've hardened your
heart for me to go after these...

00:15:51.583 --> 00:15:53.917
What? Am I wrong?

00:15:53.917 --> 00:15:55.958
What's with that murderous
look in your eyes?

00:15:55.958 --> 00:15:57.958
Misaki Matsuya!

00:15:58.292 --> 00:16:00.375
Free fall, hurray!

00:16:00.375 --> 00:16:01.250
Landing!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.958
10 points! 10 points! 10 points!
10 points! 0 points!

00:16:03.958 --> 00:16:05.667
That's no good!

00:16:05.667 --> 00:16:08.417
That was too bad, Senior.

00:16:08.417 --> 00:16:10.958
That whisper that's sweet but
on the verge of death.

00:16:10.958 --> 00:16:12.583
Hatchan?!

00:16:12.583 --> 00:16:15.250
What's this?!
Surprise camera triple-take!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:21.500
Senior, I have become trapped here.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.167
What the hell is this?!
It's beyond comprehension!

00:16:23.167 --> 00:16:24.958
A profound mystery!
Mucous membrane for a horse's ears!

00:16:24.958 --> 00:16:26.083
Are you all right, Hatchan?!

00:16:26.083 --> 00:16:30.792
I do not know, but my
consciousness is fading...

00:16:30.792 --> 00:16:32.583
In an Excel-ish way,
I can't forgive anyone

00:16:32.583 --> 00:16:34.333
who lets a thing like this
go around with a big attitude

00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:35.708
in ACROSS's basement
without permission.

00:16:35.708 --> 00:16:37.417
Hatchan, I'll save you now!

00:16:37.417 --> 00:16:39.083
I'll save you right away!
I'll save you quick!

00:16:39.083 --> 00:16:40.458
Thank you.

00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:42.500
Excel Chop!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.625
Excel Kick!

00:16:44.625 --> 00:16:47.250
Excel Backdrop!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:48.708
Plop.

00:16:48.708 --> 00:16:51.542
Look at it, there's no way
I could win against it!

00:16:51.542 --> 00:16:53.917
Who are you all watching me?

00:16:59.083 --> 00:17:00.458
"Hey, wake up."

00:17:00.625 --> 00:17:02.792
Miss Ayasugi's calf...

00:17:02.792 --> 00:17:04.250
"What are you talking about?!"

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.750
No, in my dream...

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.333
Who the hell are you,
visually speaking?!

00:17:11.333 --> 00:17:12.667
"I'm Sumiyoshi..."

00:17:12.792 --> 00:17:14.667
Where did you just
get that hand from?

00:17:14.667 --> 00:17:16.208
Well, forget about that,

00:17:16.208 --> 00:17:18.083
but there's no way you're Sumiyoshi!

00:17:18.083 --> 00:17:21.542
Our, our Sumiyoshi is a lot uglier
and doesn't use standard Japanese!

00:17:21.542 --> 00:17:23.500
"That's very rude of you."

00:17:23.542 --> 00:17:26.708
And where the hell are we?!
The situation hasn't been explained!

00:17:26.708 --> 00:17:27.875
"Take a look."

00:17:28.917 --> 00:17:30.250
What is...

00:17:42.167 --> 00:17:43.583
Oh, man...

00:17:43.583 --> 00:17:47.667
Why do we gotta witness a monster's
"exciting birth scene"?!

00:17:47.792 --> 00:17:49.083
"It lured us here in a darling guise so it
could use our energy to multiply..."

00:17:49.083 --> 00:17:50.958
Don't talk so much, I can't read it!

00:17:50.958 --> 00:17:53.292
In other words, it lured
us here by using its charm

00:17:53.292 --> 00:17:55.042
and it's going to suck
the energy from our bodies

00:17:55.042 --> 00:17:56.458
and have lots of children?

00:17:56.458 --> 00:17:57.208
"That's right."

00:17:59.167 --> 00:18:00.375
"Puchuu!"

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.542
D-Did they suck you already?

00:18:05.375 --> 00:18:08.042
Tell me straight!
What did they do to you?!

00:18:08.042 --> 00:18:10.125
"It was an irresistible force..."

00:18:10.125 --> 00:18:13.208
Quit it! Don't make me imagine things!

00:18:15.042 --> 00:18:18.458
Stay away! Don't eat me!
Don't suck from me!

00:18:20.583 --> 00:18:22.500
Stop it!

00:18:25.667 --> 00:18:28.167
Don't kill me so easily, damn it!

00:18:32.417 --> 00:18:35.625
Looks like I've shown up
just at the right time.

00:18:35.625 --> 00:18:38.125
Matsuya, you came to save us!

00:18:39.333 --> 00:18:42.458
Don't misunderstand me. This is work.

00:18:42.458 --> 00:18:44.167
You call this work for civil servants?

00:18:44.167 --> 00:18:45.542
That's right.

00:18:45.542 --> 00:18:48.417
To eliminate those who wrongfully
occupy the sewer passages

00:18:48.417 --> 00:18:50.917
as a civil servant working for
the country's sake.

00:18:53.083 --> 00:18:54.542
We'll use these weapons!

00:18:54.542 --> 00:18:55.458
R-Right!

00:18:55.458 --> 00:18:56.917
For Miss Ayasugi!

00:18:56.917 --> 00:18:58.583
Nosebleed oozing!

00:19:06.417 --> 00:19:08.042
"I can't..."

00:19:08.333 --> 00:19:10.167
Get to it!

00:19:10.167 --> 00:19:11.750
<i>P-Pokiiru</i>.

00:19:13.542 --> 00:19:14.750
"I'm cured..."

00:19:15.875 --> 00:19:17.875
I'll die right away.

00:19:17.875 --> 00:19:19.375
Doo-wop!

00:19:20.167 --> 00:19:22.125
Come on, come on, die!

00:19:23.958 --> 00:19:25.458
Matsuya!

00:19:31.208 --> 00:19:33.125
So cute.

00:19:33.125 --> 00:19:37.250
But I don't have any
interest in things like that.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:39.208
Split in two?

00:19:40.042 --> 00:19:42.042
What a scary woman.

00:19:44.125 --> 00:19:46.667
T-This is...

00:19:46.667 --> 00:19:50.792
...an opponent that a public
servant is supposed to face?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:55.625
At times like this,
regardless of the mission...

00:19:56.667 --> 00:19:57.833
...we should retreat!

00:19:57.833 --> 00:19:59.667
With pleasure!

00:19:59.667 --> 00:20:02.542
It's shaking! It's shaking!

00:20:02.542 --> 00:20:06.542
Senior, I bit my tongue...

00:20:06.542 --> 00:20:08.208
Don't die so lightheartedly!

00:20:08.208 --> 00:20:10.167
Shit! There's nowhere to go.

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:11.375
--Give me a break!
I didn't do anything bad!

00:20:11.375 --> 00:20:13.000
--Is this the end?
--Give me a break! I didn't do anything bad!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.500
--Is this the end?
--Miss Ayasugi, I'll be there soon too!

00:20:17.667 --> 00:20:19.833
Iwata?

00:20:19.833 --> 00:20:22.208
Misaki Matsuya,
I'll always come for you...

00:20:22.208 --> 00:20:24.083
Do you know what the situation is?!

00:20:24.083 --> 00:20:27.500
I don't care. No matter what happens,

00:20:28.292 --> 00:20:30.708
I'll protect you! I will protect you, but...

00:20:30.708 --> 00:20:32.958
Never mind, give me the gun!

00:20:33.833 --> 00:20:35.500
Don't do it!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.667
I'm telling you,
the model 2 is dangerous!

00:20:37.667 --> 00:20:39.583
Come on, wake up!

00:20:50.583 --> 00:20:53.000
What the?! What the?! What the?!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.208
Look at me! Excel is swimming!

00:20:55.208 --> 00:20:56.083
"F City, F Prefecture"

00:20:56.375 --> 00:20:58.042
Manhole!

00:20:59.708 --> 00:21:01.667
Water! Water! Water!

00:21:01.667 --> 00:21:03.042
H2O!

00:21:06.458 --> 00:21:07.833
It's okay.

00:21:07.833 --> 00:21:09.833
I had no other choice.

00:21:09.833 --> 00:21:11.708
No other choice...

00:21:20.958 --> 00:21:22.750
The cause for the great flood

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:25.250
that assailed F City,
F Prefecture today is unknown,

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:27.042
and though it seems
fake from a visual perspective,

00:21:27.042 --> 00:21:30.542
there were no deaths and the water
will probably subside on its own.

00:21:30.542 --> 00:21:31.708
I guess it's over.

00:21:31.708 --> 00:21:35.250
Yeah, with the way things are,
no way that monster...

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:36.583
This time!

00:21:38.125 --> 00:21:39.458
Yo.

00:21:42.375 --> 00:21:45.292
Oh, it misfired anyway.

00:21:45.292 --> 00:21:47.625
So you made it, Iwata.

00:21:47.625 --> 00:21:50.583
Yeah, if I'm going to successfully
protect justice in this city,

00:21:50.583 --> 00:21:52.125
I can't just die.

00:21:52.125 --> 00:21:55.333
Misaki, protect it with me.

00:21:55.333 --> 00:21:57.750
Are you sure you want this woman?

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.000
She just pulled the
trigger without hesitation.

00:22:02.208 --> 00:22:04.958
It seems that you were
able to repel the intruders.

00:22:04.958 --> 00:22:06.625
Well done.

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:08.792
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:22:08.792 --> 00:22:11.583
Now, for my next orders to you.

00:22:11.583 --> 00:22:15.125
First, I would like you to
do something about this water.

00:22:16.958 --> 00:22:21.667
"Episode 7: Melody of the
Underground Passage"

00:22:21.667 --> 00:22:23.625
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:23.625 --> 00:22:26.625
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:59.500
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:06.875
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.875 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:32.500
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:40.375
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.375 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:57.042
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.167 --> 00:24:02.000
For those of you crying because
you're so tired of the murders,

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.042
explosions, scheming,
intrigues, and pandemonium,

00:24:04.042 --> 00:24:05.708
Excel Saga is a pretty girl anime!

00:24:05.708 --> 00:24:07.458
This once, the staff will go back
to their original aspirations and

00:24:07.458 --> 00:24:08.917
bring you a covered-with-pretty-girls hour!

00:24:08.917 --> 00:24:10.125
We'll sooth your exhausted anime hearts

00:24:10.125 --> 00:24:11.667
and our viewer ratings
will shoot up and double!

00:24:11.667 --> 00:24:12.667
Killing two birds with one stone!

00:24:12.667 --> 00:24:13.917
Both you and I will be very happy!

00:24:13.917 --> 00:24:15.042
Good news! Good news!

00:24:15.042 --> 00:24:16.208
Everyone, please rejoice.

00:24:16.208 --> 00:24:17.625
A weird foreigner
will be appearing as well.

00:24:17.625 --> 00:24:19.667
It's an all happy,
let's go lovey-dovey plan!

00:24:19.667 --> 00:24:21.208
It'll be girls no matter how
you look at it and we'll bring you

00:24:21.208 --> 00:24:23.000
the version with all
threatening males cut out!

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:25.417
Next week, our title is
"Increase Ratings Week"!

00:24:25.417 --> 00:24:26.417
Wow, that's real straightforward.

00:24:26.417 --> 00:24:28.594
What are we gonna
do if they still don't go up?
